# Nexus master evolution

Read **`docs/NEXUS_MASTER_EVOLUTION.md`** before large UI, motion, PWA, or install work.

## Protected core (never break)

- Browser-first routing; no auth route interception
- Native mobile scroll; no dashboard body lock / touchmove preventDefault
- `LOW_GPU_ANDROID_MODE` for A05 only — **never** global UI flattening
- `NEXUS_BROWSER_ONLY_LOCK` — no aggressive SW / offline takeover / mount fetch chains
- Financial slices separate from UI slices (see `supabase-financial-integrity.mdc`)

## Priority

1. Stability + routing + scroll + A05 compositor  
2. Institutional polish (brand, glass, motion gated by low GPU)  
3. PWA/APK runtime (incremental; A05 QA each deploy)

## Brand

- Keep original Nexus “N” identity — refine, do not replace  
- No gaming neon / cloned crypto branding  

## Smart header

- Passive scroll + instant reveal on upward delta  
- `translateY` only; no body lock  

## Motion (when added)

- Framer Motion or GSAP on premium paths only  
- Auto-disable under `html.nexus-mobile-low-gpu`  

## APK / PWA

- **Current:** APK layer removed; browser-only lock on  
- **Future:** tap-triggered APK and lightweight manifest only in dedicated slices — never mixed with routing fixes  

## Kenya registration

- Soft geo warnings; no hard block on imperfect IP / carrier NAT  

## Slices

One phase per PR → deploy → A05 QA. See phase table in master doc.
